The Eclipse Public License 1.0's full text is in licenses/EPL-1.0.md. The
source of each library is at its address above.

The binary also carries the Jolt runtime (https://github.com/jolt-lang/jolt),
under the Eclipse Public License 2.0, with the libraries Jolt includes.
Jolt's own NOTICE credits those.
